			"children": [
				{
					"id": "emU3OxgquYnWoDise",
					"description": "Custodian Helm",
					"local_notes": "Integrated auto-senses (threat auto-cueing, full-spectrum vision, audio filtering) tuned to a Custodian's own enhanced Perception rather than compensating for a lesser one.\n\nLore: The distinctive full helm of Custodes plate, shown throughout Codex art and background feeding tactical and sensory data directly to its wearer with no need for the kind of black- carapace neural bridge an Astartes suit requires.\n\nDesign: Flat Observation bonus, set one point above the Astartes Mark VII Auto-senses Suite's own +2 (Imperium/Armour/Imperial Armour.eqp) to reflect superior Custodes-grade sensors feeding an already-superior Perception score, no fixed anchor exists.",
					"base_value": "20000",
					"base_weight": "5 lb",
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "skill_bonus",
							"selection_type": "skills_with_name",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
