						}
					],
					"quantity": 1,
					"equipped": true
				},
				{
					"id": "er-vIDffQ9rMoA0OT",
					"description": "Respirator & Void Seal",
					"local_notes": "Full atmospheric independence; immune to inhaled toxins and gas while sealed, vacuum-rated.\n\nLore: Custodians are shown operating in the void and in toxic environments in sealed plate, as Astartes are.\n\nDesign: Standard sealed-armour assumption carried over from the Astartes suit's equivalent subsystem; no separate anchor.",
					"base_value": "4000",
					"base_weight": "6 lb",
					"quantity": 1,
					"equipped": true
				},
				{
					"id": "eCqzVNw1tzSQO4RPE",
					"description": "Vox-Link (Integrated)",
					"local_notes": "Encrypted short-to-medium range vox built into the gorget.\n\nLore: Custodian Guard coordinate as a unit in the same way Astartes squads do.\n\nDesign: Flavour/utility subsystem; no DR or attribute effect.",
					"base_value": "3000",
					"base_weight": "2 lb",
					"quantity": 1,
					"equipped": true
				},
				{
					"id": "eiMR8IlanjW239R_6",
					"description": "Servo-Motor Actuators (Aquilon Pattern)",
					"local_notes": "The bulk of the suit's weight and cost, matching the parent item's own servo figures.\n\nLore: The core of what makes Auramite armour \"powered\" rather than merely thick.\n\nDesign: Duplicates the parent entry's own servo ST bonus for completeness of the container breakdown, as the Astartes Mark VII file does.",
					"base_value": "60000",
					"base_weight": "90 lb",
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "lifting_st",
							"amount": 10
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
