					"description": "Vratine Visor",
					"local_notes": "Basic low-light optics and audio filtering; simpler than a Custodes or Astartes auto-senses suite.\n\nLore: A modest sensory package appropriate to an unaugmented (if pariah-blooded) human wearer.\n\nDesign: Small flat skill bonus, kept deliberately below the Astartes/Custodes suites' own bonuses for the same reason the Sororitas power armour's own Auto-senses Suite is kept modest; no fixed anchor.",
